{"4864560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SCRIBBLE HUNT", "steam_appid": 4864560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint the bunny man — a hide-and-seek where you blend in like a chameleon.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/8a2cd9d3b88c648e347795f8419f9598.avif?t=1784725173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras_big/8a2cd9d3b88c648e347795f8419f9598.webp?t=1784725173 width=1560 height=215 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2–10 players in one arena. Will you be the hunter, or the hunted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiders have two ways to survive:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scribble camouflage</strong> — sample colors, match the light, tune your materials, and paint yourself seamlessly into the scene;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape-shifting</strong> — become any object in the environment, real enough to fool anyone. Hunters, meanwhile, carry high-tech paint weapons that leave no disguise unexposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/8a4a4a301b1adf34bd2854b18038a2fa.poster.avif?t=1784725173\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/8a4a4a301b1adf34bd2854b18038a2fa.webm?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/8a4a4a301b1adf34bd2854b18038a2fa.mp4?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/0f9863c82d5de351c4d56ffde52c11c4.avif?t=1784725173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras_big/0f9863c82d5de351c4d56ffde52c11c4.webp?t=1784725173 width=1560 height=216 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The rules are simple. Split into the Hunter team and the Hider team and play hide-and-seek. The Hunters win if they find every Hider before time runs out.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/03ee3a9f28559fe0e0b7622fef3f0309.poster.avif?t=1784725173\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/03ee3a9f28559fe0e0b7622fef3f0309.webm?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/03ee3a9f28559fe0e0b7622fef3f0309.mp4?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/a34139a5ae2464bcea337c0170910d30.avif?t=1784725173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras_big/a34139a5ae2464bcea337c0170910d30.webp?t=1784725173 width=1560 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than color sampling — stamp the texture and finish of nearby materials onto yourself in one tap. No parameters, no painting skills. Even total beginners blend into the scene in an instant.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/7dc0c951213800381f8c183c9beb99ef.poster.avif?t=1784725173\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/7dc0c951213800381f8c183c9beb99ef.webm?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/7dc0c951213800381f8c183c9beb99ef.mp4?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/e19ee8d9265e61c6a7134fbc22fbdc65.avif?t=1784725173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras_big/e19ee8d9265e61c6a7134fbc22fbdc65.webp?t=1784725173 width=1560 height=215 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The paint blaster fires precise shots — one splash of color and you're exposed. The splat bomb blankets a wide area, flushing out everyone in range. Pair them with the assault rifle to take down exposed targets on the spot. Maximum hunting efficiency.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/857a9dce8a9c6dc287c78a6dc35207d0.poster.avif?t=1784725173\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/857a9dce8a9c6dc287c78a6dc35207d0.webm?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/857a9dce8a9c6dc287c78a6dc35207d0.mp4?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/91ed9cda3b2ad40636ae123f92c51d86.avif?t=1784725173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras_big/91ed9cda3b2ad40636ae123f92c51d86.webp?t=1784725173 width=1560 height=215 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The last 30 seconds are the reveal round: every Hider's spot is unveiled so everyone can see just how well they blended in. Give a thumbs-up to the slickest disguises — the better the hide, the more the love!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/f1de383f1d19ad16135a98ed99143d3f.poster.avif?t=1784725173\" width=750 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/f1de383f1d19ad16135a98ed99143d3f.webm?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/f1de383f1d19ad16135a98ed99143d3f.mp4?t=1784725173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras/7ef3ed5cabc607f239dca24f8a242405.avif?t=1784725173\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864560/extras_big/7ef3ed5cabc607f239dca24f8a242405.webp?t=1784725173 width=1560 height=215 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix and match a wardrobe of skins, then top it off with slick dances and taunt poses — hide in silence, flex out loud.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/486456